    48	  render, and never tests the openpilot stack's OWN known sim-bridge path (the contract flags
    49	  a "known bridge confound, commaai issue #31711" for MetaDrive but does not clear CARLA of
    50	  the same class of issue). The sim-specificity result (c33, c37) is presented as a bound but
    51	  is equally consistent with the null hypothesis "CARLA input is malformed for this model."
    52	- SEVERITY: REJECT (this is the attack that decides the paper). For a workshop it is MAJOR
    53	  but still the single most likely cause of rejection, because it attacks the meaning of the
    54	  headline word "silent failure."
    55	- REJECT-PROBABILITY: high.
    56	- REQUIRED RESPONSE: The authors cannot argue this away with prose; they must either (a) run
